WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Keeping your work
Save, undo, switch songs, free a place in Memory, and back up to your computer.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.660
1. Save
Press EDIT and turn KNOB 1 (Sound) one step. SAVE lights up, and the header says "unsaved".

3
00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.540
1. Save
Press SAVE. When Polly is stopped, it also saves by itself after about four seconds.

4
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:19.448
2. Undo and redo
Hold HOME and press REC to undo the last change.

5
00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:26.756
2. Undo and redo
Hold HOME and press PLAY to redo it.

6
00:00:26.756 --> 00:00:33.818
3. Switch songs
Hold HOME and turn PRESETS to switch between songs S1 to S4.

7
00:00:33.818 --> 00:00:38.900
3. Switch songs
Turn it back to S1. Each song has its own sections, progressions, melodies, tempo and style.

8
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:47.390
4. Open Memory
Press SEQ, then SEL. Turn SELECT down to MEMORY at the bottom, and press SEL.

9
00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.890
4. Open Memory
Memory has 16 places. They keep your own grooves and melodies for all four songs. The header tells you how many are in use.

10
00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.990
5. Free a place
Turn SELECT to the third row, numbered 2. It holds your copy from 106, which no song plays.

11
00:00:53.990 --> 00:01:02.510
5. Free a place
Press SEL, and Polly asks if you're sure. Press SEL again, and the place is free.

12
00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.600
Next: 110
With other gear.
